[129.604126, "i", "cat > /home/github/build/failed/failed_reasons.txt << 'EOF'\n# Build Failure Analysis for AgentOps-AI/agentops\n\n## Repository: /home/github/build/failed/AgentOps-AI/agentops\n\n## Issues Identified:\n\n### Issue 1: Missing Package Discovery Configuration in pyproject.toml\n**Location**: pyproject.toml\n**Problem**: The pyproject.toml file is missing the [tool.setuptools.packages.find] section.\nThis causes setuptools to not find the 'agentops' package, resulting in:\n- Package being built as 'UNKNOWN' with version '0.0.0'\n- Dependencies not being properly installed when the package is installed\n\n**Fix**: Add the following section to pyproject.toml:\n```toml\n[tool.setuptools.packages.find]\nwhere = [\".\"]\n```\n\n### Issue 2: Unconditional Import of Optional Dependency (langchain)\n**Location**: agentops/__init__.py, line 12\n**Problem**: The file unconditionally imports from langchain_callback_handler:\n```python\nfrom .langchain_callback_handler import LangchainCallbackHandler, AsyncLangchainCallbackHandler\n```\n\nHowever, langc"]
[129.604189, "i", "hain is listed as an OPTIONAL dependency in pyproject.toml:\n```toml\n[project.optional-dependencies]\nlangchain = [\n    \"langchain>=0.0.354\"\n]\n```\n\nThis causes the entire agentops package to fail to import when langchain is not installed,\neven though langchain should be optional.\n\n**Fix**: Make the langchain import conditional using try/except:\n```python\ntry:\n    from .langchain_callback_handler import LangchainCallbackHandler, AsyncLangchainCallbackHandler\nexcept ImportError:\n    LangchainCallbackHandler = None\n    AsyncLangchainCallbackHandler = None\n```\n\n## Summary:\nTwo patches are needed:\n1. patch_1.diff - Fix pyproject.toml package discovery\n2. patch_2.diff - Fix conditional import of langchain handler in __init__.py\nEOF\n"]
[129.604343, "o", "cat > /home/github/build/failed/failed_reasons.txt << 'EOF'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
